  "solution": "**Formula used:**\n\n(A + B)² = A² + 2AB + B² \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(​​2y + 2/y) = 7​​\n\n⇒ (y + 1/y) = 7/2\n\n⇒ (y + 1/y)² = 49/4\n\n⇒ ​(y²+(1)/(y²⁾)=​ (49/4) - 2\n\n⇒ ​ (y²+(1)/(y²⁾)= 41/4​\n\n(y²+(1)/(y²⁾) = 41/4​\n\n \n\n5d:Tc37,\n<p&g",
